          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "line2": "<span class=\"fontsize-1-5-vw\">After a severe case of tonsillitis, Elizabeth found a cyst on her throat. Surgery was needed to remove the large mass under her chin. Worried about an unsightly scar after surgery, she turned to a cosmetic surgeon she trusts. Watch how Zip helped provide less scars and a quicker recovery.</span>",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Nov 17 2021 21:07:35 GMT+0000",
